      "content": "exactly. the person i was is gone. and there's no point in trying to rebuild a ghost. it feels like i'm just being forced to keep paying interest on a life that's already been spent. i just want the debt to stop. i want the books to be closed so i don't have to feel this constant weight of failing every single day. is there really any other way to truly settle the accounts when everything is already at zero?",
